<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on Novartis.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on Novartis.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC Warburg said it has issued a total of 15 million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on registered shares of Novartis.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 50 warrants.</p>
<p> PAYMENT DATE    12.MAR.97		 MIN EXER LOT 50</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS		     SPOT REF     1,700 CHF *</p>
<p>* * *</p>
<p> WARRANT   STRIKE     ISSUE     PREMIUM    GEARING     MATURITY</p>
<p> CALL A    1,800 CHF  3.20 CHF  15.29 PCT  10.63 TIMES 19.MAR.99</p>
<p> CALL B    1,750 CHF  1.80 CHF   8.24 PCT  18.88 TIMES 21.NOV.97</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
